 Our book for July is The Beginning Comes After the End by Rebecca Solnit. 
 In this sequel to her enduring bestseller Hope in the Dark \, Solnit surve
 ys a world that has changed dramatically since the year 1960. She argues t
 hat\, despite the forces seeking to turn back the clock on history\, chang
 e is not a possibility\, it is an inevitability\, and the nature of that c
 hange is determined by who participates and how. #block-1b9061cb3c5e50c329
 d8 { --stroke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-ba
