 "\;fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js\, fjs)\;})(window\, document\, 'script'\
 , 'qgiv-embedjs')\; Compassion in Crisis: Building Disaster-Resilient Comm
 unities Help is here for our bodies\, hearts\, minds\, and shared homes. B
 y amplifying resources for resilience\, the authors underscore preparednes
 s as a constant\, communal practice. They offer inspiration from frontline
  organizers who help their communities prepare for emergencies\, demonstra
 te how to envision probable futures after upheaval\, and showcase people-p
 owered projects that nurture collective regeneration. This is your invitat
 ion into the lifelong work of caring for our Earth and one another as we a
 ll find our way through the polycrisis. #block-1f4f4e24146d85cf6ccf { --st
 roke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-
